+/* Layered atmosphere (01_00 section 13) — decorative only, hidden from
+ * assistive technology, never competes with content. Found live: the
+ * first pass (a single faint radial + linear gradient) read as "flat
+ * dark background" rather than "factory at dusk" — 01_00's own reference
+ * images (image.png, image_2.png) both lean on broad overlapping bands
+ * plus a low-opacity skyline silhouette (section 7's explicit
+ * allowance), not a single soft glow. This adds a second, cooler
+ * radial (blue-violet, upper-left) to read as two light sources instead
+ * of one, a very low-opacity rust band low in the frame (section 13's
+ * own "rust-800 to rust-600 at low opacity"), and an abstract skyline
+ * silhouette anchored to the bottom edge — all strictly behind content,
+ * all far below any threshold that would touch text contrast.
+ */
 .factory-atmosphere {
   position: fixed;
   inset: 0;
   z-index: -1;
   pointer-events: none;
